ior, C's egocentric communication, D's arrogance. Also note that A's leadership and anticipation are critical. So we keep vote for A.\n\nThus PUBLIC_MESSAGE: I agree with Emily, reaffirm A, note that the remaining concerns about A are manageable, and we should perhaps probe A's organization but still recommend A.\n\nMETADATA_JSON: vote Candidate A.\n\nProceed."}
